// title: Detecting FIDO2 Passkey Abuse
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Identity
// tables: IdentityInfo, MicrosoftGraphActivityLogs
// purpose: Detecting FIDO2 Passkey Abuse
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Detecting%20FIDO2%20Passkey%20Abuse.kql
// kind: repo
